  [38;5;153mlogin()[39m return [38;5;153m{ success, user, userId }[39m and the session module consume that — which, notably, still isn't a [38;5;153muserId[39m
  [3mparameter[0m on [38;5;153mlogin()[39m.

[38;5;246m⏺ [39mUser answered Claude's questions:
