[1m[38;5;231mHow long should the stored identity survive?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mlocalStorage (persistent)[39m
     [38;5;246mSurvives browser restart; shared across tabs. Matches "other forms will need it." Needs explicit logout to clear. [39m
     [38;5;246mRecommended.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m sessionStorage (per-tab)
     [38;5;246mDies when the tab closes; safer on shared machines, but a second tab sees no identity.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m localStorage + expiry
     [38;5;246mPersistent but stamped with a timestamp and treated as expired after a set age. More code; tell me the window.[39m
